    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yerusalemu gealas uhuuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooyeawda aba ghuuta haw aba jeeda iidigeasu nea gwayi, “Nung' goosiibu fugiga ahaaghwa mujiiniin. Nea daba siisi mideawa dabita ng'ucheeda aba geatindaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghapka fih lah leabu meatkweeda gidaghuuta mida heetiyeada bea meatkweeda wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa, nea gaba nih mideawa dabita ng'ucheeda aba geatindaanyi. Nea aba jeenyaawa gwanda siyagi akwa hang'weaka bumbuni miyaas, nea gwandeawa jupajeanda wiinooyda sing'ooriida. Hean geeweay jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA, ak geamiinaada aba murdeeda heeda wagiida oomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'amwa heeda geeruubajeanda giigheambiita ASEETA Israeli. Ak gwadiyeada ea ghwahita mughoonyeanda gidaghuuta gheeda sibata ASEETA, ak gaguursa ASEETA siida akwa hang'weaka bumbuni miyaasiin, mideawa jupajeanda wiinooyda sing'ooriidean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA niny, “Siga bugusta mujiineeda Yerusalemu, ak giiroori gheamamuunatka fuga anyahuushi nea gooyeawda aba ng'asheega munyas sean sisin aba jeedeaba mujiineani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha buuneeda suurja nea abeeda geayiing'shi, “Asiga jeeda mujiini nea ghoayaachi geeshta, ak goonuuschi buuneeda adoapuuchi sih nea adoabwaydi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwara gweargwa aba geeshangiga, ea haweega ea diibiga manang'i ea gadeemga nea adoasachi siida was sean mideawa giirooraneeda, Oang'eadana heedeanyu ghaydit.” Hean geang'eada gweargwa mida madeeda gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha saawa, “Ayiina jeeda gheeda ririnnyeanda ak ghoanyiichi jeeda gheeda muscheeka fuga sibwar. Asi aweayeena.” Hean geeweay ak geabwaraada aba jeeda mujiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda sinuuseada abeeda geapuudan nea geabwaageaw, hean ghaabeadi ak ghaabwadi jih ng'eanyi ak geayeawdi nea geayeenyi, “Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, gaylasa uhuuda fuga sean bea Israeli ghayi siipuut nea ginung' gwasa nyarastaang'u aba badayda Yerusalemu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeeshiinean, “Riing'eeda fuga Israeli ea Yuda aasaang'a muuchi, ak ng'eanyiida ea ninyiit foojeanda. Nea jeeda mujiini ea manda doobiiwnata aba gideaba gwayi ‘NG'UTAMIIDA ninung'wa heeda ng'eanyiini nea NG'UTAMIIDA ea mwadaaha.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aniini ea maydasiksa saawa, nea maydabwayda gaydasima giteena sinaweega nyaawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweadu iita siidida akwa hang'weaka bumbuni miyaasiin mideawa jupajeanda wiinooyda sing'ooriidean nea gwayi, “Neasindi gidirukuteaydi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
